Package: PhysioNeurophys
Title: TMS and Peripheral Motor Neurophysiology Analysis
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Provides transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS) and peripheral
    motor-neurophysiology analysis for PhysioExperiment objects. Includes
    motor-evoked-potential amplitude and latency, Boltzmann recruitment curves,
    H-reflex recruitment and Hmax/Mmax metrics, F-wave persistence and latency,
    paired-pulse inhibition and facilitation, cortical silent-period timing,
    TMS-EEG pulse removal, source-informed SSP-SIR and SOUND cleaning,
    TMS-evoked-potential summaries, the PREP2 upper-limb stroke-prognosis
    algorithm, and a governed TMS pulse and intensity metadata schema.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2),
    PhysioExperiment (>= 2.0.0)
Imports:
    SummarizedExperiment,
    S4Vectors,
    stats
Suggests:
    PhysioCore,
    PhysioEMG,
    PhysioEEG,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
